  "seoTitle": "Tito Karnavian And Various Institutions Receive National…",
  "metaDescription": "Minister of Home Affairs Tito Karnavian and multiple Indonesian entities, including bank bjb and Pekanbaru Lestari, have been recognized with national awards.",
